   "evidence": "DiffAdd.lean:250-255 already handles `2 = 0` this way, and DiffAdd.lean:266-270 gives the `2 \u2260 0` direction for arbitrary `P`, `Q`. The PR's proof (Ladder.lean:85-90) recomputes `diffAdd_x` and `diffAdd_z` case by case on `k % 2` instead of reusing them.",
