   "fix": "Add a general lemma to DiffAdd.lean: `diffAdd_eq_zero_of_cross_eq_zero (hB) {P Q} {SP SQ SD} (hP hQ hD) (h : P - Q = 0 \u2228 P - Q = twoTorsionPoint A hB) : diffAdd SP SQ SD = 0`. Prove it like `diffAdd_cross_eq_zero_of_cross_eq_zero`: when `2 = 0`, `4 = 0` makes the output zero; when `2 \u2260 0`, it is the contrapositive of `diffAdd_ne_zero_iff_of_cross_eq_zero`, after first removing any zero representative, which by homogeneity forces the output to zero. Then derive the `k \u2022 T\u2080` lemma from it using `hsub : (k+1)\u2022P - k\u2022P = P`, with no parity split.",
